        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Fragment, either used on furnishing or on costume, made of plain weave embroidered with a reticella geometrical design.  On each side of the design is a curved embroidery motive done in gold thread and blue, green and pinkish silk thread.\nThepiece is edged with bobbin lace made of gold thread and green and blue silk."@en ;
